- **Thriving Moor** - dual land (enters tapped)\n\
- **Tolarian Kraken** {4}{U}{U} - 4/6 flyer, creature tap/untap effect\n\
\n\
This is a solid hand with:\n\
- Mana sources (Island, Thriving Moor)\n\
- Early play (Fetid Imp at 1B)\n\
- Good creatures (multiple flyers, especially the 5/5 Ormos and 4/6 Tolarian Kraken)\n\
- Card draw engines (Erratic Visionary, Liliana's Standard Bearer)\n\
\n\
